<<<readme>>>
## Webhook setup (WhatsApp Cloud API)

The bot starts a webhook server on `PORT` (default 3000). Point Meta at it:

1. Create a Meta app with the WhatsApp product at
   <https://developers.facebook.com/apps/> and copy the access token, phone
   number id, and app secret into `.env`.
2. Expose the server on a public HTTPS URL — deploy it, or tunnel during
   development (e.g. `ngrok http 3000`).
3. In the app dashboard under WhatsApp → Configuration, set the webhook
   callback URL to `https://<your-host>/webhook`, enter the same verify token
   as `WHATSAPP_VERIFY_TOKEN` in `.env`, and subscribe to the `messages`
   webhook field.

Then message your business number on WhatsApp to try it out. Note the Cloud
API is DM-only — group chats are not supported.
